      "lines": [
        "123. 集体农庄的果园里有1 200棵树，其中有一半是苹果树，",
        "三分之一是梨树，其余的是樱桃树。果园里有多少棵樱",
        "桃树？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "124",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "124. 用简便方法计算下列各题：",
        "$(865+70)-165\\quad(456+144)-104\\quad(28+12)\\cdot6$ ",
        "$(164+250)+50\\quad(94+835)+165\\quad(34+56)\\cdot8$ ",
        "$(270+340)-260\\quad(546+280)-326\\quad(200-184)\\cdot5$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "125",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "125.* 解释下列方程的解法：",
        "$x\\cdot3+12=27\\quad(c+18)\\cdot2=40\\quad20-a:4=17$ ",
        "$x\\cdot3=27-12\\quad c+18=40:2\\quad a:4=20-17$ ",
        "$x\\cdot3=15\\quad c+18=20\\quad a:4=3$ ",
        "$x=15:3\\quad c=20-18\\quad a=3\\cdot4$ ",
        "$x=5\\quad c=2\\quad a=12$ ",
        "验算：　验算：　验算：",
        "$5\\cdot3+12=27\\quad(2+18)\\cdot2=40\\quad20-12:4=17$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
